{"content":[{"c":["JEHOHANAN"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Korahite Levite who was a gatekeeper of the sanctuary during David’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.26.3","r":"1Chr.26.3","rawR":"1Chr.26.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.26.3","value":"1Chr.26.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 26:3"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Commander of thousands in King Jehoshaphat’s army (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.17.15","r":"2Chr.17.15","rawR":"2Chr.17.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.17.15","value":"2Chr.17.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 17:15"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Father of Ishmael, commander of a unit of soldiers who helped the priest Jehoiada overthrow the wicked queen Athaliah of Judah (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.23.1","r":"2Chr.23.1","rawR":"2Chr.23.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.23.1","value":"2Chr.23.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 23:1"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Eliashib’s descendant who owned a chamber into which Ezra retired to pray, fast, and mourn for his people (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.6","r":"Ezra.10.6","rawR":"Ezra.10.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.6","value":"Ezra.10.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:6"},"). He is possibly the same as Johanan, a grandson of Eliashib the high priest (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.22-23","r":"Neh.12.22-23","rawR":"Neh.12.22-23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.22-23","value":"Neh.12.22-23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 12:22-23"},", ",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"), and Jonathan (a textual variant), Joiada’s son, in ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.11","r":"Neh.12.11","rawR":"Neh.12.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.11","value":"Neh.12.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nehemiah 12:11"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. One of Bebai’s four sons, who was exhorted by Ezra to divorce his foreign wife (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.28","r":"Ezra.10.28","rawR":"Ezra.10.28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.28","value":"Ezra.10.28"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:28"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["6. Son of the Ammonite official Tobiah and a contemporary of Nehemiah. He married a Jewish woman whose father, Meshullam, had helped repair the Jerusalem wall (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.6.18","r":"Neh.6.18","rawR":"Neh.6.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.6.18","value":"Neh.6.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 6:18"},"; ",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," “Johanan”)."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["7. Priest and family leader in postexilic Jerusalem during the time Joiakim was high priest (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.13","r":"Neh.12.13","rawR":"Neh.12.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.13","value":"Neh.12.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 12:13"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["8. One of the priests who participated as a singer in the dedication of the rebuilt Jerusalem wall (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.42","r":"Neh.12.42","rawR":"Neh.12.42","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.42","value":"Neh.12.42"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 12:42"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Jehohanan","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 26:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.26.3","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.26.3","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.26.3"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 17:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.17.15","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.17.15","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.17.15"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 23:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.23.1","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.23.1","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.23.1"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.6","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.6","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.6"},{"anchorText":"Neh 12:22-23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.22-23","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.22-23","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.22-23"},{"anchorText":"Nehemiah 12:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.11","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.11","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.11"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 10:28","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.10.28","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.10.28","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.10.28"},{"anchorText":"Neh 6:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.6.18","rawQueryValue":"Neh.6.18","sourceRefExact":"Neh.6.18"},{"anchorText":"Neh 12:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.13","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.13","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.13"},{"anchorText":"Neh 12:42","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.42","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.42","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.42"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"4e011cee39e6d1ed502bdb0ad2136ebdf324d4c03f440e644c2178c657ac0f69","sourceItemName":"Jehohanan","sourceItemOrder":146,"sourceMember":"Articles/J.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Jehohanan","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Jehohanan","title":"Jehohanan","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}